TI  - EUROLAB: A Multidimensional Labour Supply-Demand Model for EU Countries
AU  - Narazani, Edlira
AU  - Colombino, Ugo
AU  - Palma, Bianey
VL  - 16
IS  - 3
PY  - 2023
DA  - 2023/12/31
